            "description": "**GET /api/github/connect** 🔒\n\nGenerates a 10-min signed state and `302`-redirects to `https://github.com/login/oauth/authorize` (scopes `read:user user:email repo`).\n\n⚠️ Disable \"Follow Authorization header\" / auto-redirect in Postman to inspect the 302. Not configured → `501`."
          },
